<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\春の兆し.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\駅前.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MOTION "789" "人物1" "4" "540" "100" "NORMAL" "WAIT"}
{PLAYSND "SE\down1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"<STYLE ID="1">Kogori-sama</STYLE>! <STYLE ID="2">Niimura-sama</STYLE>! For this humble servant's many blunders, I most humbly beg your pardon!
{PAUSE ""}
　I, the genius girl Erina Goto, have committed the blunder of a lifetime...! Sob... sob...!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Goto<STYLE ID="3">, the moment she joined us, performed a magnificent sliding kowtow.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="2">, forget it and get to the platform already! We absolutely can't miss the next one!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n4\r\n100\r\n300\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="2">Niimura-sama</STYLE>! Allow this humble servant to carry your luggage!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Forget it and just walk!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"As you command!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Goto<STYLE ID="3"> started walking half a step behind, like a retainer.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\電車進行中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\Shortbridge03-1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "800" "3000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島挨拶バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\電車ボックス席.gal" "NORMAL" "4" "1000" "960" "1" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="1">Kogori-sama</STYLE>! These rice balls, made by <STYLE ID="4">your </STYLE><STYLE ID="5" RUBY="ごそんぼさま">honored mother</STYLE>!
{PAUSE ""}
　They seep into this humble servant's <STYLE ID="6" RUBY="ごそうろっぷ">very innards</STYLE>...!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Those rice balls were made by my </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, though...?"</STYLE><PG>
"What! <STYLE ID="7">Your </STYLE><STYLE ID="8" RUBY="ごそんぷさま">honored father</STYLE>!
{PAUSE ""}
　Well, well, <STYLE ID="1">your</STYLE> <STYLE ID="9" RUBY="ごいっとうさま">honored family</STYLE> are omniscient, omnipotent gods who bring <STYLE ID="10" RUBY="たい">peace</STYLE> to this land of the rising sun!
{PAUSE ""}
　Beings enthroned upon the endless clouds of heaven, watching over all that lives, so far beyond <STYLE ID="11" RUBY="じんち">human understanding</STYLE> as to be practically a concept"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="2">... you're starting to get annoying..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="12" RUBY="ク">Que</STYLE> <STYLE ID="13" RUBY="ドローガ">droga</STYLE>! How could this humble servant!" [TN: in Latin letters in the source.]<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"What's that supposed to be, 'Ku Droga'..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="2">Niimura-sama</STYLE>! The words this humble servant spoke were―"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Okay, talk normally again already!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　And 'humble servant' is something men say!" [TN: Goto's word for 'I' here, shosei, is used by men.]</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島挨拶バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Ha! Just what I'd expect from <STYLE ID="2">Niimura</STYLE><STYLE ID="14" RUBY="うじ">-uji</STYLE>! All right! Then I'm switching back to normal! [TN: -uji: a quaint, mock-formal honorific.]
{PAUSE ""}
　That just now was Portuguese, and it means 'What the heck!'
{PAUSE ""}
　Droga's a word that originally means narcotics and drugs! It's real close to the English <STYLE ID="15" RUBY="ドラッグ">Drag</STYLE>!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Completely broken, that's what </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="3"> was.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">It had to be because she was really sorry about being late... probably...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="1">, we're not mad, so go back to talking like you usually do..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"If you talk weird any more than this...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\超炭酸.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">I'll make you chug a Super Soda Bomber."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Ugh...! N-not that...!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="16"> brought the bottle near </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="16">, and like a magnet, </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="16">'s face moved with it</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"So why were you late? </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="2">, isn't this the first time you've ever been late?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Actually...
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ黄ストラップ切.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島挨拶バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
Remember how the other day we got <STYLE ID="17" RUBY="そろ">matching</STYLE> phones as presents?
{PAUSE ""}
　While I was getting ready to leave, this turned up in my closet, so I put it on!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Goto<STYLE ID="3"> thrust the strap dangling from her new phone at us.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ青ストラップ切.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh? It's the same as ours, just a different color. Where'd you buy it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Who knows... Seems it was a looong time ago, and my mom says she doesn't remember either. 
{PAUSE ""}
I kept thinking about when it was, and..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">So that was why she was late.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Goto<STYLE ID="3"> stays fixed on a thing once she starts thinking about it, so before she knew it, it had gotten that late.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, where did we buy this strap?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花頭かく.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Hmm, when was it... I already had it when I came back to Motoki-cho... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="18">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and the others probably just bought them somewhere around here, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ赤ストラップ切.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"I see... I take good care of mine too, so it feels like there's some memory attached to it, but... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I've forgotten it now."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I gazed at the faded strap with its fraying fabric.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1,アイテム2,アイテム3" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島頭を抱えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
{QUAKE "" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="19"><TXSPS>"And so... I am... truly... sorry...!</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<TXSPN>　This genius girl, as everyone agrees, me included, has committed a blunder worthy of <STYLE ID="20" RUBY="ばんし">ten thousand deaths</STYLE>...!"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Well... hey, they say there's a fine line between genius and idiocy, don't they?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物3" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
"Huh!? Am I an idiot!?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Hm? At this point, you've got something to say back?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="12" RUBY="ク">Que</STYLE> <STYLE ID="13" RUBY="ドローガ">droga</STYLE>..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="16">Either way, leaving </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="16"> behind had never been an option.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島挨拶バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Ehehe! But I'm happy! Me and you <STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE> even have <STYLE ID="17" RUBY="そろ">matching</STYLE> straps!
{PAUSE ""}
　Maybe we were friends, and we just don't remember!?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="2"> as a friend, huh... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
You<STYLE ID="2"> were a cheeky, logic-obsessed brat even back when you were little, weren't you?"</STYLE><PG>
"That's not true! Ever since I was little, I've been a <STYLE ID="21" RUBY="かれん">dainty</STYLE>, <STYLE ID="22" RUBY="せいそ">demure</STYLE> pretty girl, just like you see!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yeah, yeah, got it, got it."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">Come to think of it...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I feel like, a long time ago, I went to Zahha with a little girl, and to a zoo somewhere.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> wasn't the one... so was it </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="3">?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Maybe I'm overthinking it.</STYLE>
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "123" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">―Eventually, we reached the last transfer station.</STYLE><PG>
