{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">This was apparently called </STYLE><STYLE ID="23" RUBY="とよたけえき">Toyotake Station</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">. We would have to wait about 30 minutes for the next train.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Ahh, man! If </STYLE>a certain somebody<STYLE ID="2"> hadn't been late, I bet we'd be at Arata Station by now!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "540" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
