{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Grrr...! I can't say a thing against that..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">It was away from the city, and though it wasn't an unstaffed station, it was pretty rural.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Waiting a whole 30 minutes was a bit of a drag.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey, want to step out the ticket gate for a bit?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
