{MESON "500"}
Goto<STYLE ID="3"> hurried off to the ticket gate.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE>That girl<STYLE ID="2">'s full of energy... Even I'm a little tired by now..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I was starting to find it hard to keep sitting, too.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島挨拶バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"It's fine, I'm telling you! Let's go, let's go!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Though she'd made the same trip as us, </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="3"> was full of energy.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Being young must be nice...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\Shortbridge03-1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\豊岳駅外.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "4" "1000" "960" "1" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Past the ticket gate there was only a small roundabout and a kiosk.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Come to think of it, I feel like Motoki-cho used to look like this too, a long time ago.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Then,</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
