{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">a girl was walking along by herself, looking all around.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh? Is that </STYLE><STYLE ID="24">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\紅葉のダンス.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="24">"Oh! It's </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="24">! What are you doing here!?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"We've got time to kill till the next train, so I figured we'd take a little walk around. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="24">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, what are you doing here?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="24">"It's just me, by myself? I came here on an errand, but... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="24">the usual ice cream stand isn't here."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花頭かく全身.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"You came all the way here by yourself!? How'd you even get here..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜手を上げる.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="24">"For me, running over the mountain is way faster than the train!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="24">　The train goes all the way</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="24"><TXSPS>aroooooooooooooooooooound</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="24"><TXSPN> that mountain, so it's a really long way around!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\豊岳.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "200" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Well, for </STYLE><STYLE ID="24">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, a mountain like this is probably no different from flat ground..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">The 'mountain like this' right in front of the station.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">What is a mountain...?</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "111" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="24">"Hey, hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="24">, walk home with me! That way's shorter, isn't it!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み全身.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Y-you're joking! Don't lump me in with </STYLE><STYLE ID="24">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, you </STYLE><STYLE ID="25" RUBY="ましら">monkey</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Besides, it's not just me. There's two more of us!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">With that, </STYLE><STYLE ID="24">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> turned her eyes toward us.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜手を上げるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="24">"Whoa...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="24">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> ran up to us, her eyes sparkling.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="24">"You're both super cute! Um, the small one is </STYLE>Goto-chan<STYLE ID="24">, and the big one is </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="24">, right!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="24">　Nice to meet you! I'm </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="24">'s cousin, Kana Niimura!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh? Oh, uh... nice to meet you..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"N-nice to meet you..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="24">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="24">, do you always walk around with pretty girls like these </STYLE><STYLE ID="26" RUBY="はべ">attending</STYLE><STYLE ID="24"> you!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="24">　I'm pretty sure... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="24">with a trio of high-school girls, usually two are cute and one's just so-so, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Don't talk like I'm the so-so one, you damn </STYLE><STYLE ID="24">brat</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="24">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="24">, did you know!? When you hit on a trio of girls, they say you should talk to the most so-so one!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="24">　Then, out of ugly female jealousy, the two cute ones'll tag along too!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
