{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Gahh! Still the same un-cute little </STYLE><STYLE ID="24">brat</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">! Nobody's ever hit on me!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="24">"Ahh, I see... </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="24"> always intimidates guys like that, so maybe they get scared off...</STYLE>
