<STYLE ID="24">This kid</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> isn't cute...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物3" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>, that <STYLE ID="24">Kana-chan</STYLE> girl... she seems really happy to see <STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai</STYLE>."<PG>
