<STYLE ID="24">"All right, everyone, let's set off on a fun mountain-climbing trip!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I keep telling you we're not going! We're taking the train!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="24">"Whaaat!? I wanna go for a walk with </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="24"> and </STYLE>Goto-chan<STYLE ID="24">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"You two, don't worry about her. If you keep up with a </STYLE><STYLE ID="24">wild child</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> like that, you'll be dead before we reach Arata."</STYLE><PG>
